SUMMARY: Just FOUR Laughs
DESCRIPTION:The only show with FOUR top comedians doing headlining sets! 
 This month featuring:\n\nTODD GRAHAM (Don't Tell\, Roast Battle Canada)\n
 BITA JOUDAKI (This Hour Has 22 Minutes\, Children Ruin Everything)\nSASHA
  MARK (JFL Vancouver\, Killjoy Comedy)\nREBECCA PAYNE (JFL Toronto\, Toro
 nto Sketchfest)\n\nTICKETS: comedybar.ca/shows/just-four-laughs https://c
 omedybar.ca/shows/just-four-laughs\n\nSaturday\, April 25 @ 7PM at Comedy
  Bar\, 945 Bloor St. W.\, Toronto\n\nToronto's best monthly standup comed
 y show! The only show where all the acts are headliners! Just FOUR Laughs
 \, the last Saturday night of the month\, always at Toronto's best comedy
  club\, Comedy Bar! If you are looking for "things to do in Toronto" look
  no further! See you on Saturday\, April 25 @ 7PM!\n\nAccessibility: Come
 dy Bar is a basement venue with 16 steps down to the entrance. Washrooms 
 are located on the main floor.
