SUMMARY: Startup Founder Night: Where Ideas Meet | Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Join a curated startup networking event in Toronto designed f
 or founders\, entrepreneurs\, builders\, and investors.\n\nMeet the right
  people\, exchange ideas\, and turn conversations into real opportunities
  within the local startup ecosystem.\n\nWho Should Attend\n\n• Startup fo
 unders (early-stage or scaling)\n• Aspiring founders and entrepreneurs\n•
  Engineers\, builders\, and operators\n• Investors and angel investors\n•
  Anyone looking to enter the startup ecosystem\n\nWhat to Expect\n\n• Hig
 h-quality networking with founders and builders\n• Meaningful conversatio
 ns (not just small talk)\n• Opportunities to find collaborators or co-fou
 nders\n• Access to investors and startup ecosystem participants\n• A cura
 ted environment focused on real outcomes\n\nStartup Pitch Opportunity\n\n
 Upgrade your ticket for a chance to pitch your startup live.\n\nSelected 
 founders will:\n• present their startup to a curated audience\n• receive 
 direct feedback\n• connect with potential partners and investors\n\nPitch
  spots are limited and require application.\n\nFor Investors\n\nJoin a cu
 rated group of early-stage founders and startups.\n\n• Discover emerging 
 opportunities\n• Connect directly with builders\n• Access curated dealflo
 w\n\nInvestor access is complimentary upon approval.\n\nAbout Ascent Vall
 ey\n\nAscent Valley is a global startup ecosystem connecting founders\, b
 uilders\, and investors through curated events and community.\n\nWe creat
 e structured environments where people don’t just network — they collabor
 ate and build.
