SUMMARY: Canadian National Air Guitar Championships
DESCRIPTION:The Canadian air guitar event of the season is BACK! Witness 
 the face-melting riffs of Canada's greatest air guitarists from across th
 e country go head-to-head to see who is most deserving of the the title o
 f 2026 Canadian Air Guitar Champion! The winner will jet off to represent
  Canada at the 2026 Air Guitar World Championships in Oulu\, Finland this
  August 26-29th!\n\nAir Guitar is an expression of World Peace - When you
  are holding an Air Guitar\, you can’t be holding a gun! Air Guitar Canad
 a is a not-for-profit and all our events benefit our chosen charity partn
 er. This year\, we're partnering with Food Banks Canada to support fighti
 ng hunger across Canada! #MakeAirNotWar\n\nBring cash to Boost the Ballot
 \, or shelf-stable food items to be donated to the Toronto Food Bank to e
 arn yourself some extra votes! Limit of 5 food items per attendee.\n\nThi
 nk you've got what it takes to win it all? Sign up to compete as a Dark H
 orse! https://forms.gle/zQfCVGNKobFVpxgAA Registration for competitors cl
 oses May 19th!\n\nWondering how it all works? Get all the details on our 
 website! https://www.airguitarcanada.org/\n\nACCESSIBILITY NOTICE: Ground
  Control is a first-floor venue accessible with no stairs at the entrance
  and an accessible washroom on site. 19+. Alcohol served on site. Unisex 
 bathrooms on site. This show will involve flashing lights and loud music.
CATEGORIES:Competition,Ground-Control,Rock-Music
